# The global ~/.gitignore excludes *plan.md and *requirements.md, and core.ignorecase
# is true on APFS — so PLAN.md and REQUIREMENTS.md matched and were silently never
# tracked. Found at the v2.0 milestone close on 2026-08-28, when 19 PLAN.md files and
# REQUIREMENTS.md turned out to exist only in the working tree.
#
# These are planning artifacts and belong in history alongside their SUMMARY files.
!*PLAN.md
!*REQUIREMENTS.md
